{"id":4728,"date":"2016-06-13T14:02:38","date_gmt":"2016-06-13T14:02:38","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/www.myjammindjs.com\/?page_id=4728"},"modified":"2026-06-04T19:14:59","modified_gmt":"2026-06-04T19:14:59","slug":"atlanta-anniversary-party-dj","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/atlanta-anniversary-party-dj\/","title":{"rendered":"Anniversary Parties\/Reunions"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2>Atlanta Anniversary Party DJ &amp; Family Celebration Entertainment<\/h2>\n<p>Atlanta anniversary party DJ services from JAMMIN\u2019 DJs help families celebrate milestone moments with music, announcements, dancing, and entertainment that fits the crowd. Whether you are planning a 25th anniversary, 50th anniversary party, family reunion, family barbecue, block party, or private celebration, our team can help create a fun and organized event experience.<\/p>\n<p><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"no-wp-caption alignright wp-image-5778\" src=\"https:\/\/jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/Wedding-St-Clair-4-5eb20d62dca12.jpg\" alt=\"Atlanta anniversary party DJ entertainment with guests celebrating by JAMMIN\u2019 DJs\" width=\"401\" height=\"267\" srcset=\"https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/Wedding-St-Clair-4-5eb20d62dca12.jpg 960w, https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/Wedding-St-Clair-4-5eb20d62dca12-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/www.jammindjs.net\/wp-content\/uploads\/2020\/05\/Wedding-St-Clair-4-5eb20d62dca12-768x512.jpg 768w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 401px) 100vw, 401px\" \/><\/p>\n<p>Every family celebration has its own style. Some events need background music and simple announcements. Others need dancing, games, photo booth options, lighting, and a DJ who can keep multiple generations engaged. Because of that, JAMMIN\u2019 DJs starts by learning your vision before recommending the right entertainment package.<\/p>\n<h3>Entertainment for Anniversary Parties, Reunions &amp; Private Events<\/h3>\n<p>JAMMIN\u2019 DJs provides DJ entertainment for anniversary parties, family reunions, private parties, backyard celebrations, BBQs, block parties, birthday parties, and other special family events. In addition, we can help with music planning, event flow, announcements, lighting, and optional photo booth services.<\/p>\n<p>Our goal is to make your celebration feel personal instead of cookie-cutter. We can help you build a playlist that reflects your family, your guests, and the memories you want to celebrate.<\/p>\n<h3>Personalized Music Planning<\/h3>\n<p>Once your date is reserved, we encourage communication in the months before your event. This helps us customize the entertainment around your family, music taste, timeline, and event style.<\/p>\n<p>We also provide access to online planning forms, event timeline tools, and music request lists. You can add songs to your must-play, play-if-possible, and do-not-play lists, so the music feels like your event instead of ours.<\/p>\n<h3>DJ, MC, Lighting &amp; Photo Booth Options<\/h3>\n<p>Your DJ can do more than play music. Depending on your event, JAMMIN\u2019 DJs can help with announcements, introductions, special dances, family moments, games, and transitions throughout the celebration.<\/p>\n<p>For a more complete experience, you can also ask about lighting, uplighting, photo booth rentals, and other event enhancements. These options can help create more energy, better photos, and more ways for guests to enjoy the celebration.<\/p>\n<h3>Plan Your Anniversary Party or Family Event<\/h3>\n<p>Whether you are planning a milestone anniversary, reunion, BBQ, block party, or private celebration, JAMMIN\u2019 DJs can help you choose the right music, sound, lighting, and entertainment options for your guests.<\/p>\n<p><a class=\"greyButton\" href=\"http:\/\/www.myjammindjs.djintelligence.com\/quote\/index.asp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Get an Anniversary Party Quote<\/a><\/p>\n","protect